@startuml
title RevKit — Sequência UC02: Criar Payload Privado
skinparam maxMessageSize 120

actor "Usuário" as user
participant "PayloadLive.Form" as form
participant "Catalog" as catalog
participant "Repo" as repo
database "SQLite" as db

user -> form : preenche template, alvo, notas e tags
user -> form : envia o formulário
form -> catalog : create_payload(owner_id, attrs, tag_ids)
catalog -> catalog : require_owner(owner_id)
catalog -> catalog : verifica cota de edições privadas

alt cota excedida
  catalog --> form : {:error, :limit_reached}
  form --> user : erro de limite
else cota disponível
  catalog -> catalog : valida attrs (Payload.changeset)
  catalog -> repo : transaction: insert + replace_tags
  repo -> db : INSERT payloads + payloads_tags
  db --> repo : ok
  repo --> catalog : {:ok, payload}
  catalog --> form : {:ok, payload}
  form --> user : redireciona para a página do payload
end

note over catalog, db
  A criação sempre grava owner_id:
  o catálogo público permanece intacto.
end note

@enduml
